        "content": "Vida Diaria Inteligente\n\nAGENDA: Calendar \u2192 Conflictos \u2192 Optimizaci\u00f3n\nTAREAS: WhatsApp \u2192 Priorizar \u2192 Recordar\nEMAIL: Gmail \u2192 Filtrar \u2192 Resumir \u2192 WhatsApp\nRUTINAS: Matutina + Nocturna por WhatsApp",
